window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Can the roughnecks who work this lonely Montana horse ranch ever be tamed?</b><br> <br> These roughneck cowboys aren’t ready for the city girls who stumble their way into big sky country and bring them to their knees... Sparks will fly, igniting intense, passionate love stories as fierce and untamed as the land these men call home. Can the roughnecks who work this lonely Montana horse ranch ever be tamed?<br> <br> Four full-length novels included. Extra steamy, highly emotional.<br> <br> <b>Hunter &amp; Isobel</b>. Hunter’s a Montana big animal vet who’s one night stand with a mysterious woman turns into more than he bargained for when she shows up as his intern the next morning…<br> <br> <b>Liam, Mack, &amp; Calla</b>. Liam’s an Irish playboy and Mack’s an ex-con. It’s mutual hate between them until they run into the gorgeous tomboy, Calla, at the local bar. Together, they find the one place all of their differences disappear: the bedroom.<br> <br> <b>Reece &amp; Charlotte</b>. After accidentally landing in the middle of nowhere, Charlotte finds herself on a ranch full of huge, muscled men. Reece is gentle, funny, sexy, and kind, but just when she begins falling for him, her dangerous past catches up with her.<br> <br> <b>Jeremiah &amp; Ruth</b>. Jeremiah is nothing like his twin brother, Reece. Jeremiah’s rough, sarcastic, and not about to put up with Ruth, who he’s thrown into planning his brother’s wedding with. Nope, he’s not gonna think about her at all… apart from the chemistry that he can’t help from sizzling beneath their burning hatred for one another.</p> <p><i>TWs</i>: Please check the author’s website.</p>"; 
